Ah, a troubled mind will steal the rest from any soul, sure enough. Mayhap a tea of valerian and a drop of honey before the fire would settle yer nerves, for I've seen it work wonders on many a long night. *Le cúnamh Dé*, ye'll find your sleep again soon enough, mo chara.
